=REPLY (via Alta, {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_channel }}), from {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.full_name }} at {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_name }}:

{{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_text }}

Classify it. Output JSON only.

=LEAD: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.first_name }} {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.last_name }} | {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.job_title }} | {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_name }} | {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.lead_email || $('Alta Normalize').first().json.linkedin_url }}
SOURCE: Alta ({{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_channel }} reply)
EMAIL TYPE: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.is_freemail ? 'PERSONAL/FREEMAIL, the domain is the email provider, NOT the company; web-search the real company + phone' : ($('Alta Normalize').first().json.lead_email ? 'business domain' : 'no email, LinkedIn lead') }}
LOCATION: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.city }}, {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.state }}, {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.country_code }}
DOMAIN: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.domain }}
LINKEDIN: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.linkedin_url }}

COMPANY DATA (from Alta enrichment; fields may be missing, verify with web search):
industry: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_industry }} | size: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_size }} | revenue: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_revenue }} | founded: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_founded }} | HQ: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_hq }}
Description: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_description }}
Technologies: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_tech }}

COMPANY FIRMOGRAPHICS (DiscoLike, empty/ignore for freemail):
{{ JSON.stringify($('DiscoLike BizData').first().json) }}

