{{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_text }}

RECENT EXCHANGE (only their reply is available for this channel):
THEM: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_text }}

Run the qualification. Output structured JSON, and include a "situation_summary": ONE plain-English line (max 140 chars) stating what the prospect signaled and what they want next. Resolve vague replies like "sure"/"yes"/"ok" into the actual thing they agreed to or asked for. Never paste the raw reply verbatim; no names, signatures, or URLs. Also include a "verdict_reason": ONE plain-English line (max 120 chars) stating why this lead is or is not a fit, citing the deciding factor.

